# oracle: pair_style meam/ms, eight H and Ga4 atoms in a 7.5 A periodic box (rc = 5.9 A, so most pairs see periodic images, and the screening neighbours of the three-body terms include images), after a fixed displacement; pe, pressure and forces of one configuration Measured with native LAMMPS (black box): max relative error 2.8e-14 (fy of atom 4; pass at 1e-13, fail at 1e-14).
# oracle-inputs: w128ms_library.msmeam w128ms_HGa.msmeam
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-12 abs=1e-14 atomrel=1e-12
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p       p       p
atom_style      atomic
region          box block 0 7.5 0 7.5 0 7.5
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 single 0.3 0.4 0.2 units box
create_atoms    2 single 2.4 0.9 0.6 units box
create_atoms    2 single 0.9 2.6 0.5 units box
create_atoms    1 single 3.1 3.0 2.9 units box
create_atoms    2 single 5.6 0.3 3.4 units box
create_atoms    2 single 4.4 5.1 1.2 units box
create_atoms    1 single 1.3 5.7 4.6 units box
create_atoms    2 single 6.2 6.6 6.1 units box
mass            1 1.0079
mass            2 69.723
neighbor        1.0 bin
neigh_modify    once no every 1 delay 0 check yes
pair_style      meam/ms
pair_coeff      * * w128ms_library.msmeam H Ga4 w128ms_HGa.msmeam H Ga4
thermo_style    custom step pe press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
run             0
